<h1>Capital One to EVA Air Transfer Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">Calculate exact EVA Air Infinity MileageLands® miles received from Capital One Miles using the official 4:3 ratio. Features 1,000-point blocks, Royal Laurel award sweet spots, and processing time insights.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>Direct Answer:</strong> Capital One Miles transfer to EVA Air Infinity MileageLands® at an official <strong>4:3 ratio</strong> (every 1,000 Capital One miles convert to 750 EVA Air miles, or 0.75 miles per point). Capital One charges <strong>$0 in transfer fees</strong>. Transfers are non-reversible and typically process within 24 to 48 hours.
</div>

